  "real_card_integration": "Bloody Sickle repository IR: target raw defense105 becomes98 after one damage via clamped99 read; caster HQ20->19 and one draw remain correct.",
  "remaining": [
    "Numeric fixture uses valid objects, stable raw getters, controlled before-receive callback and source-order/unit flags, and deferred destruction; no whole lifecycle certification.",
    "Native backend bytes are PE-revalidated; physical encryption/CRC errors, object lifetime and malformed pointers remain open.",
    "Explicit caller-supplied precomputed damage/oldDefense paths and full combat/batch numeric parity are not newly certified.",
    "Global subscription ordering, missing dealer native defaults and all card-specific branches remain separate scopes.",
    "Actual card regression executes repository IR; card asset version/end-to-end PvP certification is not established."
